                    <head>
                        <choice>
                            <abbr>GDR</abbr>
                            <expan>German Democratic Republic</expan>
                        </choice>-<choice>
                            <abbr>FRG</abbr>
                            <expan>Federal Republic of Germany</expan>
                        </choice>-Israel. Following our Telegram No. 73 of 12.4.</head>
                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Review of the situation in the <choice>
                                <abbr>GDR</abbr>
                                <expan>German Democratic Republic</expan>
                            </choice> following the elections. The new parliament has passed a resolution recognizing Germany's crimes against the Jews and instructing the government to work for establishment of relations with Israel. Open official negotiations with the <choice>
                                <abbr>GDR</abbr>
                                <expan>German Democratic Republic</expan>
                            </choice> are proposed.</summary>
                    </msContents>
                    <history>
                        <origin when="1990-04-16">16.4.1990</origin>
                    </history>
                </msDesc>
            </sourceDesc>
